        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium electrolysis, plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium electrolysis, plant
Medium sized plant. Output: 130'000 t/a, life time: 50 years. Site is shared with casting plant. Total land use is allocated 50% to electrolysis, 50% to casting.;
UUID: c213f4a1-86db-3b96-b8f0-f6bbc0c3aad9
Port, production hall, machinery and administrative buildings (including disposal)
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Technology of one medium sized plant in Norway
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c213f4a1-86db-3b96-b8f0-f6bbc0c3aad9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
